    hold GRIP on handle/tsuba/blade spine (1H or 2H)
    GRIP + B/Y: recall a weapon
    B/Y (no grip): dummy attacks on/off
    stick click: change element
    A/X: reset the dummy
Desktop: see the top-left of the window"
font_size = 32
outline_size = 8
horizontal_alignment = 0
vertical_alignment = 0
modulate = Color(0.8, 0.85, 0.95, 1)

